 piece and  it'll be all the more hype as we're  about to see we got a one-piece color  spread coming this chapter and it could  not sound better it's gonna be a color  spread of the new yonko namely of buggy  Shanks Blackbeard and Luffy this sounds  like the kind of cover spread I want to  use a poster and just stick it on the  wall in my room the rest are the ones  containing Nami on the beach we're told  greenbull has a logia and not a mythical  Zone which honestly is probably a good  move since if I think about it we've  already had a lot of mythical zones  especially considering the fact that  it's supposed to be the rarest category  I get that Oda probably doesn't want to  Kill the Magic by having too many but at  the same time they're so hyped so I'd  personally forgive the quantity the  logia is called morimori no me and of  course I looked up Modi on Google and it  comes out as the Japanese word for  Forest so he has the forest forest fruit  and that is very cool because it's very  Broad and potentially Greenville can use  any ability you can find in a forest  we've already seen Roots but I'm sure he  has plenty more tricks up his sleeves  and again this reminds me even more of  hashirama from Naruto now and you know  how revered he was as the First Hokage  and how revered his wood style was as  well so I think Oda is really trying to  build up green bull even more here we  know Green bowl is a approaching the  party with our main characters in the  last chapter and we're told in this one  Yamato hits Greenville in the head on  the one hand this is hype because we're  going to get this highly anticipated  fight to start on the other hand though  Yamato has officially joined the crew  yet and it would suck like really hard  if green bull injures her so badly or  even kills her so she can't either way  I'm hoping backup isn't far behind since  this dude just took out queen and king  like they were nothing the most hyped  part of this overall hype chapter comes  next we are told Shanks you heard that  right the pirate from chapter one who  inspired Luffy's journey and who I made  a one hour long video about Link in the  description yes that red-haired yonko he  is on the shores of get this wano  country and he says it's time to go for  the one piece wow I got goosebumps just  reading that part to myself this is  insane on so many levels and let's cover  a couple of these levels one of course  it's the big moments set up in the  beginning that Luffy will meet Shanks  again when he's a great pirate that was  25 years ago and now that moment is  finally here I've also been saying now  for a while that it's time for them to  meet because Luffy has undeniably become  a great pirate especially after gear  pipe being the strongest creature in the  world and becoming a yonko two the  implication here is that Shanks and  Luffy are going for the one piece  together now this may very well be  Complicated by Blackbeard at some point  but having a Luffy Shanks Alliance  making their way for the one piece is  amazing to think about not to mention  the fact that the series is called one  piece and we have Shanks mentioning how  the time has come to get it so hype one  can't even verbalize how big of a deal  this is if you guys recall when he was a  kid shank stayed with a sick buggy when  Roger went for the final Island so he  never sighed for himself in fact shank  said that they meaning he and buggy  would go with their own ship one day now  that time appears to have come and if we  take the flashback into account and  specifically shanks's words yonko buggy  May well join them on their Journey  after all who didn't love seeing buggy  and Luffy work together at impel down it  was awesome it was peak one piece they  made such a hype team and by the way if  anyone wants to count how many times I  said hype in this video and post in the  comments feel free to but I think you'll  agree it's Justified because this  chapter was that word n